[{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「哈啊、啊啊……呼、呼……哈……将臣，你的大●鸡，哪怕是在学校里，也是这么有精神」","art":{"background":"a3996","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你也是呀，做到一半的时候，你几乎都要失神了吧」","art":{"background":"a3996","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「那都是因为你的攻势太激烈，让我忘记了自我……」","art":{"background":"a3996","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"其实我也一样。","art":{"background":"a3996","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我用亲吻传达了我的心意。","art":{"background":"a3996","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「唔……嘻嘻，我爱你，将臣」","art":{"background":"a3996","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也爱你，蕾娜」","art":{"background":"a3996","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们再一次亲吻对方。","art":{"background":"a3996","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"就这样，我们紧紧地抱在一起……","art":{"background":"a3996","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"是因为太过紧张，导致睡眠太浅？还是因为明天事关重大，今晚睡得太早？","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"半夜，我突然醒了过来。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「呼……嗯……呼……」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……蕾娜好像还睡得很香」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"她这几天一直在努力写稿子，大脑肯定很累了。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"不管怎么说，蕾娜确实了不起。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我就很不中用了，大晚上的一点睡意都没有。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"院子那边似乎还亮着灯。大家应该还在干活。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"要不要去帮帮忙呢？","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"感觉他们肯定会赶我走。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，对了」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我突然想起了一件事。那是之前一直想做，却一直没做的事。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这个时间……应该还醒着吧。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我悄悄爬出了被窝，拿起了手机。为了不吵醒蕾娜，我尽量压低了一切声音。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「…………？」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"来到客厅后，我打开通讯录，找到了家里的座机号码。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"跟蕾娜的家人视频通话过之后，我也一直都想给家里打个电话。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"但由于我没事很少给家里打电话，所以不知不觉就拖到了今天。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……嗯，趁现在打一个吧」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"仔细想想，多亏了我妈那句话，我才会来到穗织。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"既然现在要迎来终结了，再一次听听她的声音也挺好的。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我鼓起勇气，按下了通话键。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"要是她已经睡了，那就下次再打吧。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『你这是怎么了，大半夜打电话过来』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『难不成是出什么事了？大半夜的你可别吓我啊』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「怎么一上来就说这个」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我刚听见我妈的声音，就有点后悔了。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"她离这里很远，不清楚这里的状况是理所当然的。但这声音未免也太悠闲了吧。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『没办法啊，你主动打电话过来，真的是太稀罕了』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，嗯，抱歉……我就是想偶尔联系一下」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「最近还好吗？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『我这边不用你担心，你在那儿过得怎么样啊？』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，这个……」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『有没有好好吃饭？功课没落下吧？』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『没给你外公添麻烦吧？有没有好好给他们帮忙？』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『真是的，越说我越担心』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，没问题的……嗯」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"她连珠炮弹似的抛来这么多问题，说实话，搞得我有点心烦。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"每当看到别人家父母对孩子的关爱，我还是会很感动的。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"可为什么面对自己的爹妈时，就会感觉很麻烦呢？我都有点想马上挂断了。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「没什么大不了的，就是偶尔打个电话联系下」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『呵，自己打来还嫌麻烦』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这都被听出来了。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"但我刚才说话的时候你不是也没仔细听吗。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『行吧，不说这个了。下次要是再打，就挑白天打』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『刚才看到来电人是你，大半夜的真是吓死我了』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我知道了我知道了，那我就……」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我刚把手指伸出去，又突然改变了主意。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『怎么了？还有什么事吗？』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不是，呃，那个……」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「妈，谢谢你」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『……你怎么了？吃坏肚子了还是吃坏脑子了？』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不是啊，我就是感觉，小时候天天惹你们心烦……也没什么别的意思」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『啊？怎么突然说这个？这是死亡Ｆｌａｇ？』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"至于说得这么恐怖吗。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"早知道就不说了。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是我错了行吧，那先挂了！」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这次我终于将手指伸向了挂断按钮。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『瞧你说得……』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"挂断之前又听见了我妈的声音，我到底还是没能按下去。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『瞧你说得，我们怎么可能心烦呢』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……哎？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『确实，你小时候总是让我们担心，但嫌你烦是不可能的』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『不过，现在你也长大了，就算不打电话过来，我们也不至于整天忧心忡忡的』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『你不在身边，我们倒也过得悠闲自在』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我不在，你跟我爸就能尽情做各种爱做的事了？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！！』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"她突然爆笑了起来，吓得我赶紧把手机拿开。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『确实，也有这方面的原因』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「天下还有这么诚实的爹妈啊」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"服了，我爸妈的脑回路就是不一般。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"不过，事到如今我也想明白了一些事情。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"新婚时的夫妻一旦当了父母，哪怕再怎么想过二人时光，也不得不优先自己的孩子。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"现在我不在，若是能让他们找回年轻时的感觉，倒也不失为一件好事。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『我猜你那边肯定是有了什么事吧』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哎？为什么这么说？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『你突然打电话过来，突然说这么严肃的事，那我肯定会这么想啊』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊、啊……」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"说的也是。我有点太小看我妈了。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「其实，我交到女朋友了」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『ｙｕｋｊｇｎｖｊｎｙｌｉｌｍｏｐ！！？』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哇啊！？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我赶忙把手机从耳边拿开。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"都喊出乱码来了，这情绪变化也太诡异了吧。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『孩子他爸！孩子他爸～～～！将臣说他有女朋友了！……什么？』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『你现在喝什么酒啊！……喝酒庆祝？对哦，我怎么没想到！？你赶快去买啤酒，买一打回来！』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『对，放车后备箱里！……哎？你问我去哪买，我怎么知道！反正不开车肯定搬不了，放后备箱里！全放后备箱里！！』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"看来，并不只有蕾娜的家人会那样。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"日本的家庭也差不多。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你别这么激动行吗！大半夜的也不嫌吵……你在听吗？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『你快说说，你女朋友是个什么样的女孩？话说明天我要不要去趟发廊！？』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「明天？等等，我可没说明天要带她去见你们啊」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『哎？不来啊？哎？……孩子他爸，不用去了』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『车钥匙？不用找了，你就继续喝你的啤酒吧』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，真是的，反正，她是个很重视家人的女孩」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「所以，受她影响……我觉得我也该好好孝敬下父母才行，就是这样」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『你怎么这么喜欢立死亡Ｆｌａｇ啊』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊？唉，哪有你这样当妈的，亏我一片好心」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"无论我再怎么努力，我家爹妈估计也就这样了。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"哪怕即将面临最终决战，他们也并不会给我加油鼓劲什么的。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『我说啊，你不用考虑什么孝敬父母之类的问题』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不，这不行的吧」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『没事，你能健康长大，我们就已经感恩戴德了』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「感恩戴德？对谁，对神仙？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『傻孩子，肯定是对你啊』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"啊。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『下次有空了，记得把女朋友带来介绍下啊。可以直接带家里来』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊……嗯，我到时候问下她」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也想给你们好好介绍下」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"都子的声音","text":"『那我就好好期待那一天了』","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，那我先挂了」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"话说回来，仅仅只是知道儿子有女朋友了，就兴奋成那样。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"等他们知道女朋友是外国人，那岂不是要上天了？","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……将臣」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a683","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「蕾娜！是我把你吵醒了吗？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a683","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「不是，你一直没回来，我就过来看下是怎么回事」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a667","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「抱歉，我马上就回去……嗯？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a667","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"蕾娜轻轻地抓着我的袖子。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a667","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「将臣，你也打算……带我去见你父母吗？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3998","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯……那当然了」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3998","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「只要你愿意的话」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3998","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我当然愿意啦！」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3727","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"蕾娜紧紧地抱了上来。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3727","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「明天我必须得加油了呀」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3917","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「见父母之前，得先给诅咒画上一个完美的句号才行」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3917","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「嗯…………我说，将臣」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a692","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「怎么了，蕾娜？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a692","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「那个……我在想……」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a667","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「你之所以会把我介绍给你父母，都是因为我们成为了恋人，是吧？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3565","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，你把我介绍给你父母，也是因为这个吧？」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3565","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是的。我们相识之后，也会进一步认识各自的家人」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3549","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「就这样，我们又构成了一个更大的家庭」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a653","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……嗯，说的也是」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a653","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「虽然，我和我的家人……还有你和你的家人」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a667","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「大家并不是生活在一起」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3572","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「但是……尽管住在不同的地方，也依然有一条纽带连接着我们」","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[{"asset":"a3959","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"或许正如蕾娜所说。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"只要我们的交往顺利进行下去，就很有可能建立起那样的关系。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"哪怕各自住在地球的两端，那条纽带也不会被切断。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"比起真正意义上的结合，这样的精神纽带或许才更接近奇迹吧。","art":{"background":"a3997","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-1"}]